{"parse": {"title": "TSW-05", "pageid": 100958, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-04\" title=\"TSW-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-06\" title=\"TSW-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.87.AA.E7.84.B6.E7.9A.84.E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"自然的故事\">自然的故事</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 自然的故事</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Nature's Solution</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>位<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>德<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鲁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192305</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhaiyewan\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhaiyewan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜晚静悄悄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手轻轻敲响了房门，动作小心，略带局促。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔哒”一声，门兀自打开了，投出一道暖黄的光线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的脸从门口探进来，像海豚好奇地探出水面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看见一抹身影等候在夜灯之下，正如传闻中所言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉静如树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>您好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绿眸凝望着她，等待她的倾述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310817.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310817.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这么晚了，我想您已经休息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>不必拘谨，乐手小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整个白天都在忙碌，芭卡洛儿也只好在夜幕降临的间隙，造访这位深居简出的小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我有一个问题想请教您，这个问题对我非常重要，所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>我想这个问题与我有关，很乐意为你提供分内的帮助，请说吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐手纤细的手指在裙摆前绞动着，眼前的德鲁伊象征着一种权威。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她既充满希望，又有些畏惧答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>槲寄生小姐，我想知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>移植罗盘草的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使这沉默十分短暂，也让她心生不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>你想在箱内种植罗盘草吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>是、是的！可以吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>即使在我的时代里，这也是一种罕见的植物，它长在远离大陆的海岛上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>有过这样一段日子，具备药用价值的植物风靡一时，但很快，特效药代替了它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与那些蔓草枝叶，或是沉默的树干联系紧密的女士轻轻地梳理回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>大多数时候，人们追求便利快捷，缺乏等候一株植物自然生长的耐心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>这是外界的贸易抵达了海岛，却没有让罗盘草流转到繁荣大陆的原因之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>况且，植物和人一样，拥有自己的故土，罗盘草无法种植在别处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这个答案，乐手的心头一紧，像在演奏中弹错一个致命的音调，大脑一片空茫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>没有……没有一点办法吗？我不太了解植物，如果我很小心，很小心地照顾它呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>哪怕我只能种一棵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>乐手小姐，植物对环境的选择远比你想象中的要严苛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>在这里种植罗盘草，它并非无法成活，只是会变成一株普通的植物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>普通的……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>努库泰澳人熟悉故乡不同的土壤，他们用不同的方法培育罗盘草，这更像一种文化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>一种无法被复刻的文化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子……图图石子她该怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>她还把最后的罗盘草都用来做罗盘灼灼了，都怪我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声轻轻的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>乐手小姐，你为你的朋友而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我想帮助图图石子，但我把一切想得太简单了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>你的朋友，她来找过我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>她熟悉罗盘草的习性，也知道它离开海岛的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>于是她问我是否有一种魔法，可以在海岛之外延续罗盘草的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这心愿过于稚嫩，于是显得动人，于是令人更加不忍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>她认为我是一位故事里无所不能的德鲁伊，将希望寄托于我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>如果我们正身处在某个故事里，我也希望重新书写它的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>但自然的故事总是由自然本身执笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……谢谢你告诉我这些，槲寄生小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根枝叶爬上她的肩头，叶片舒展，轻触面颊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是种在身旁的一棵小树，神秘术唤醒了它，释放存在的信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>荧树枝，叶片和新芽都能发光。折下一枝，浸到水中，它会长出根系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>根系成团，埋到土里，枝叶重新长成树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>让它去帮助你们照亮夜晚吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶中水轻晃，荧树枝摇曳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自然的朋友传授给她方法，为树枝修剪出斜斜的切口，找出一个无人问津的细颈花瓶，浸入三分之一的清水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它果然散发光芒，照亮床前的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>见面的时间将近，她今天带来光明的树枝，想要抚平心绪的褶皱。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>也许可以省下一些珍贵的罗盘草……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子……图图石子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一起制作罗盘灼灼的房间里空荡荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罗盘灼灼已经尽数完成，整齐地靠放在墙边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>棕榈树皮外壳被细细编织，细密而整洁，装饰洁白的贝壳，与罗盘草的根系交汇成一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子这么快就做好了……她肯定没有停下来休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>她去哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走了出去，匆忙的脚步掠起一阵风。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我……我找不到图图石子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>图图石子小姐……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我们约好一起做罗盘灼灼，但是她在夜里把所有罗盘灼灼都做好了！可是现在她不见了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>情况略显焦灼，助手思考着，眉头蹙起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>今天是箱庭贸易节，人会比以往多，我们分头去问问有没有人看到图图石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-310811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-310811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-310811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>匆匆离去，跑得裙摆飞扬，一心寻找她的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露天营地中，箱庭贸易节的布置已经初步成形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半开的箱子，卷起的铺布，告示板，落地灯，小帐篷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭卡洛儿穿过凌乱的一地，想大叫图图石子的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-310801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-310801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-310801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>如果图图石子能听见我在叫她，她一定不会没有反应……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸了一口气，酝酿着足以媲美乐器的惊人音量，准备脱口而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——被一只拍上肩膀的手打断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>呼——咳、咳咳咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大量的空气呛住了她，使她一时咳得停不下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罪魁祸首只好又拍拍她的背，等候她的平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们找到图图石子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>她……她现在是一个人吗？她怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想她需要一些独处的时间。所以我和十四行诗没有去打扰她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不过，独处的时间总会结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你愿意陪伴她度过结束后的时光吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭卡洛儿的脚步总比回答来得更快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她留下一个背影，以及远远传来的一串声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我当然愿意——！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-05"}}